  "goodToKnow": "Das Kinn is the chin: ein spitzes Kinn, das Doppelkinn (double chin). Der Kinnhaken is an uppercut in boxing. To encourage someone, Germans say Kopf hoch! (head up!) rather than chin up. The word is related to English chin. Don't confuse it with das Kino (cinema) or das Kind (child). Plural: die Kinne."
